      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "PREPARE ONCE. Select the H3 VIDEO VAE and upload the source dance video to Load Video. Audio is ignored. Video is resampled to 24 fps. A 7-second / 168-frame clip is padded by repeating the final frame to 175 frames (H3 17n+5), preserving all the input motion.\n\nSave to models/refpacks/dance.safetensors. The file contains the full VAE encode and the 2-fps RGB frames used by the text encoder. File size is larger than a latent-only RefMod. Use trim tail for native tail-trimming behavior. Reference megapixels controls token count and compute; full references still cost attention during every sampling step.\n\nRoles are numbered automatically within each role; there is no role ID field. Outfit and Location tags are aliases resolved to native picture slots before encoding. To use a location, prepare location.safetensors, enable its loader, and add at <Location 1> to the prompt.\nStill-image packs are shared across H3 Image and Ref2VA. Reuse the same character/outfit/location file; no target selection or second encode. Motion packs remain video-only."
      ]
    }
